
<h3>Welcome to the Sobek Digital Demonstration Instance</h3>

<p>This instance will be utilized for short running demonstrations, and access can be requested from Sobek Digital, via the contact us page.  This fully functioning site can demo searching, uploading new items, and administrative features.  In the near future, we will begin resetting all the data and digital resources on a regular basis.

</p><p>Once you are registered, and given system administrator rights, you can change this text by hovering over this text once you are logged on.</p>

<p>Material that appears on this site will be transient and should not be bookmarked or used directly in research.  If you have any questions about material that appears on this site, please do not hesitate to <a href="&lt;%BASEURL%&gt;contact">contact us</a>.</p>

<p>This site is maintained by <a href="https://sobekdigital.com">Sobek Digital Hosting &amp; Consulting, LLC</a>.</p>
  

  

  

  

  
